<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠνοῦχος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dog-leash,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.298
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>), acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, but more prob. in signf. <i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλοιὸς κ.</span>
			<i>dog-collar</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				107
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>calf-skin sack</i>, for carrying hunting-nets, etc., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				2.9
			</span></i>; also, for use as a <i>clothes-locker</i> in the
			gymnasium, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>purse, money-bag,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PCair.Zen.
				22.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				442
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				461
			</span></i><i>A a</i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.Dion.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				206
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i></div>
